  "releaseNotes": "Add HCR087 (BaseAddress missing a trailing slash) and HCR088 (typed client without an HttpClient constructor). Extend HCR041-HCR043 to ConfigureHttpClientDefaults registrations, and harden the response, stream, request-reuse, timeout, and base-address analyses against false positives.",
